<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-slides – Templates</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/pt/tags/templates/</link><description>Recent content in Templates on go-slides</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>pt-BR</language><atom:link href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/pt/tags/templates/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Templates</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/pt/templates/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.14/pt/templates/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;A apresentação é um &lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/text/template" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;text/template&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; do Go,
avaliado &lt;strong&gt;antes&lt;/strong&gt; de o Markdown ser analisado. Tudo o que a linguagem de
templates do Go tem — ações, pipelines, &lt;code&gt;if&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;range&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;with&lt;/code&gt;, variáveis —
funciona em uma apresentação.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="data"&gt;Dados&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="data"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#data" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;O ponto (dot) do template contém as chaves do front matter, depois as chaves do
mapeamento &lt;code&gt;data:&lt;/code&gt;, depois os dados informados na linha de comando ou em
&lt;code&gt;slides.yaml&lt;/code&gt; — cada um sobrescrevendo o anterior.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;marp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;Quarterly review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;Platform&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nn"&gt;---&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gh"&gt;# {{ .title }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Presented by the {{ .team }} team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pela linha de comando:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Flag&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Fornece&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--data file.yaml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;um arquivo YAML ou JSON de dados (repetível)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--set key=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;um valor (repetível)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="generating-slides"&gt;Gerar slides&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="generating-slides"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#generating-slides" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;O corpo inteiro é um só template, então um &lt;code&gt;range&lt;/code&gt; que escreve &lt;code&gt;---&lt;/code&gt; escreve
slides:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{{ range .releases }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gh"&gt;# {{ .version }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{{ range .changes }}- {{ . }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{{ end }}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;{{ end }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="page-and-total"&gt;Página e total&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="page-and-total"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#page-and-total" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{ page }}&lt;/code&gt; e &lt;code&gt;{{ total }}&lt;/code&gt; são o número do slide e o número de slides. Eles só
são conhecidos depois que a apresentação foi dividida, então são preenchidos
nesse momento — uma apresentação gerada conta os slides que gerou.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="cm"&gt;&amp;lt;!-- footer: &amp;#34;{{ page }} / {{ total }}&amp;#34; --&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copiar código"
aria-label="Copiar código"
data-copied-label="Copiado!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="include"&gt;Include&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="include"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#include" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;{{ include &amp;quot;parts/agenda.md&amp;quot; }}&lt;/code&gt; insere outro arquivo, relativo à
apresentação.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="code-is-left-alone"&gt;O código é deixado em paz&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="code-is-left-alone"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#code-is-left-alone" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blocos de código delimitados e trechos de código em linha são postos de lado
antes de o template rodar e restaurados literalmente, então um slide sobre
templates Go pode mostrar &lt;code&gt;{{ .Name }}&lt;/code&gt; sem escapá-lo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="turning-it-off"&gt;Desativar&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="turning-it-off"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#turning-it-off" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Link permanente para esta seção"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;--no-template&lt;/code&gt; lê a apresentação como Marp simples: &lt;code&gt;{{&lt;/code&gt; é texto.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>